            "review_title": "Review at Com Ga Hai Nam Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Kevin W Chan\nKuala Lumpur, Malaysia305 contributions\n0\nChicken Rice, Vietnamese-local-Chinese style!\nJan 2017\nHaving came from Malaysia, we are too familiar with the Hainanese chicken rice famous in Malaysia (and even Singapore) - the HCMC Version, however, could 'cure' a bit of our craving for the chicken rice! \nHowever, the chicken could be a bit 'hard' (or perhaps the local love it hard?)\nIt would be better if the soup can cut down on MSG.\nOverall, a place to fill your stomach whenever you feel like craving for a Hainanese Chicken Rice!\nRead more\nWritten February 15, 2017",
