            "review_title": "Review at Com Ga Hai Nam Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Ashley D\n4 contributions\n1\nYummy Chicken Rice!\nNov 2016 • Solo\nI've only ever gotten delivery from here a bajillion times. I've tried their Hainan Style Chicken rice, Roasted Chicken Rice, and Roasted Duck Rice. I loved ALL of them! If you're looking for a soup, I like the pig bone soup with carrots. \n\nI think chicken is a better deal over duck which is almost double the price. Tip: they don't charge delivery and will deliver for even just one plate. Score! Just make sure to order before they close at 11PM. Also, they exclusively speak Vietnamese and Cantonese.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten November 26, 2016",
